  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Faire progresser les r&#xE9;sultats d&#x2019;apprentissage en Afrique (ALOA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Youth Professional Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(USAID Office of Diversity, Equity, Inclusion, and Accessibility (A/DEIA)):  USAID will work in Kenya to support awards that increase employability and skills development for youth from marginalized communities. USAID will build a collaborative bridge between U.S.-based Historically Black Colleges and Universities, select Kenyan universities, and the private sector, including US-based companies. Partner universities will participate in capacity enriching activities such as exchanges, curriculum and course development, and research to help prepare a generation of innovative Kenyan leaders to meet evolving market demands. Private sector partners will amplify USG resources, providing input on practical skills, experiential learning experiences for university students, mentorship, shadowing opportunities and jobs. Partnerships will benefit US and Kenyan interests, advancing economic development specifically in the field of information and communication technologies and Science, Technology, Engineering, and Math (STEM) education.  .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Advancing Learning Outcomes for Africa (ALOA) est une initiative quinquennale de 65 millions de dollars financ&#xE9;e par l&#x2019;Agence des &#xC9;tats-Unis pour le d&#xE9;veloppement international (USAID) pour aider &#xE0; concevoir, mettre en &#x153;uvre et &#xE9;valuer des programmes d&#x2019;&#xE9;ducation et de jeunesse en Afrique subsaharienne (ASS). Les objectifs de l&apos;initiative comprennent&#xA0;:&#xA0;Support technique&#xA0;: fournir un soutien technique opportun et pr&#xE9;cis pour les progr&#xE8;s de l&apos;&#xE9;ducation en Afrique. Renforcement des capacit&#xE9;s&#xA0;: renforcer les capacit&#xE9;s des missions et des organisations partenaires locales. Preuves et mesures&#xA0;: renforcer les preuves et les mesures.</narrative>
  </description>
